exports[`rhx enroll --as slug collision (acceptance) given: [case1] \`@:foreman\` already claimed by the default-roleset actor when: [t0] a DIFFERENT actor tries \`--as @:foreman\` (\`-driver\` roleset) then: the collision error is locked to a snapshot 1`] = `
